WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.080
- I could either save
money or I could just--

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.411
- Wow, those look good.

00:00:04.411 --> 00:00:06.301
- Should we get some?

00:00:06.301 --> 00:00:07.978
- I don't know. They're pretty gay.

00:00:07.978 --> 00:00:08.978
- We're gay.

00:00:10.169 --> 00:00:11.002
- Alright, fine.

00:00:11.002 --> 00:00:15.169
Excuse me, sir, two of
those fruity drinks, please.

00:00:16.576 --> 00:00:17.409
- Good call.

00:00:17.409 --> 00:00:19.576
- Yeah, these are amazing.

00:00:20.816 --> 00:00:21.956
How does this look?

00:00:21.956 --> 00:00:23.597
- It looks good, that's why I bought it.

00:00:23.597 --> 00:00:24.430
- Yeah?

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:26.012
- Mhm.

00:00:26.012 --> 00:00:28.692
As long as you don't do that.

00:00:28.692 --> 00:00:29.555
(mumbling)

00:00:29.555 --> 00:00:30.613
- [Waiter] How would you like to--

00:00:30.613 --> 00:00:32.613
- [Both] We'll split it.

00:00:34.511 --> 00:00:35.344
Are you scrolling through

00:00:35.344 --> 00:00:36.684
some random guy's Instagram right now?

00:00:36.684 --> 00:00:39.560
- Yeah, but look how hot he is.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:42.090
- Oh my God. He is hot.

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:44.840
Wait, click on the shirtless one.

00:00:46.252 --> 00:00:48.252
Wait, what's his handle?

00:00:52.196 --> 00:00:53.384
Wait, did you wash your hands?

00:00:53.384 --> 00:00:54.717
- No.
- Come on!

00:00:56.637 --> 00:00:58.201
- Can I be the little spoon?

00:00:58.201 --> 00:00:59.908
- Just one more minute.

00:00:59.908 --> 00:01:01.158
- It's my turn.

00:01:02.319 --> 00:01:03.152
- Fine.

00:01:11.776 --> 00:01:13.211
(belching)

00:01:13.211 --> 00:01:14.044
- Nice.

00:01:18.910 --> 00:01:19.795
- Yes, queen!

00:01:19.795 --> 00:01:20.628
- Mhm.

00:01:21.768 --> 00:01:22.998
- Get swole, bro.

00:01:22.998 --> 00:01:25.667
- Don't stop, don't stop.
- Get swole!

00:01:25.667 --> 00:01:29.038
Can you believe marriage equality
only passed two years ago?

00:01:29.038 --> 00:01:29.871
- I know.

00:01:30.775 --> 00:01:33.358
It really makes you think, huh?

00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:36.097
- I love you.

00:01:36.097 --> 00:01:37.597
- I love you, too.

00:01:38.634 --> 00:01:41.051
(jazz music)

